    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43271" root="لحى" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِحَآءٌ</span></b>  <i>Bark;</i> and in particular the <i>bark</i> of a
plant, or of a tree, <i>of which ropes &amp;c. are made.</i>
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِحَآء</span> of the date is [its <i>Pulp, pulpy
pericarp,</i> or <i>flesh;</i> i. e.] the <i>part that clothes the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَاة</span> [or <i>stone</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِحَآءُ العِنَبِ</span> [<i>The skin
of grapes</i>]. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شحم</span>.)

